# This is an orphan assets branch: it holds only the media the README links to.
#
# Without this, a `git add -A` run while the main working tree is checked out
# sweeps every untracked file into the branch -- which is exactly what happened
# on its first push. Ignore everything, then allow the assets explicitly.
*
!.gitignore
!*.webp
!*.gif
!*.png
